# Committed on purpose: unlike most packages, this list can not be generated (EA4-303).
#
# debify normally generates a deb's .install from the RPM's file list, but this deb
# ships different files than the RPM: the RPM is a dnf plugin (universal_hooks.py,
# /etc/dnf/plugins/universal_hooks.conf, …) while the deb is an apt hook
# (apt-universal-hooks.conf and apt-universal-hooks.pl). The deb's files are not in
# the RPM, so no RPM file list (or `et obs --file-list-changed`) can produce them;
# this file is the only source for them.
#
# debify uses it as-is and never checks it, so keep it in sync by hand with what
# override_dh_auto_install.sh / SOURCES provide for the deb. See ea-tools docs/debify.md.
apt-universal-hooks.conf /etc/apt/apt.conf.d
apt-universal-hooks.pl /etc/apt/universal-hooks
